  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mtext>Σ</mtext><mrow><mtext>k</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∞</mo></munderover><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mtext>k</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mtext>k</mtext></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mtext>k</mtext><msqrt><mtext>k</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mtext>a</mtext></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mtext>b</mtext></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mtext>c</mtext></msqrt></mfrac></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>]</mo></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math> is equal to</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
