  "solution": {
    "text": "Here, general term <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Rationalising the expression, we get,<br /><br /><math> <mo>⇒</mo> </math> <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>T</mtext> <mtext>k</mtext> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>k</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <msqrt> <mtext>k</mtext> </msqrt> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>k</mtext> <msqrt> <mtext>k</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>k</mtext> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>k</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>-</mo> <msup> <mtext>k</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>k</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></math><br /><br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>4</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>T</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>-</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>5</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>&nbsp; and so on<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></math><br /><br />Adding all the terms, we get,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>..</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></math><br /><br />Now, if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></munderover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>1</mn> </msqrt> <mo>+</mo><msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn><msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>1</mn> </msqrt> <mo>+</mo><msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>8</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> <mo>+</mo><msqrt> <mn>4</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> <mrow> <msqrt> <mrow> <mn>16</mn></mrow> </msqrt> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br />As,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mo>⇒</mo> </math> any other solution is not possible<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math>",
